        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "   Ayah saya bekerja di bank itu sejak",
          "   tahun lalu.",
          "   = My father has worked at that bank",
          "     since last year.",
          "",
          "One root, kerja, and the affixes you have",
          "already met build a whole family out of",
          "it:",
          "",
          "   kerja       work, the thing",
          "   bekerja     to work",
          "   pekerja     a worker",
          "   pekerjaan   a job",
          "   dikerjakan  is being worked on",
          "",
          "Learn the root and the family costs you",
          "almost nothing. This is why Indonesian",
          "vocabulary gets cheaper as you go."
        ]
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "The same machine on other roots you have:",
          "",
          "   ajar    belajar    pelajar   pelajaran",
          "   teach   to study   a pupil   a lesson",
          "",
          "   tulis   menulis    penulis   tulisan",
          "   write   to write   a writer  writing",
          "",
          "   main    bermain    pemain    permainan",
          "   play    to play    a player  a game",
          "",
          "Read the two ends of a long word before",
          "the middle. The pe- and the -an around",
          "pekerjaan tell you it is a noun before",
          "you have even found kerja inside it.",
          "",
          "Tier 4 teaches those endings one at a",
          "time. This lesson is the map."
        ]
      }
    ]
