          "   makan  eat       makanan  food",
          "   minum  drink     minuman  a drink",
          "   jawab  answer    jawaban  an answer",
          "   tulis  write     tulisan  writing",
          "   lukis  paint     lukisan  a painting",
          "   pilih  choose    pilihan  a choice"
        ]
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "Wrapped in pe- ... -an or per- ... -an,",
          "the root becomes the process, the event",
          "or the place where it happens.",
          "",
          "   terbang  fly    penerbangan  a flight",
          "   adil     just   pengadilan   a court",
          "   tahu     know   pengetahuan  knowledge",
          "   temu     meet   pertemuan    a meeting",
          "   raya     great  perayaan     a festival",
          "   jalan    walk   perjalanan   a journey",
          "",
          "peN-...-an takes the nasal shapes of meN-",
          "(Lesson 8); per-...-an goes with ber-:",
          "bertemu, pertemuan.",
          "",
          "Read both ends first: a word wrapped like",
          "this is a noun before you know its root."
        ]
      }
